{"loggedAt":"2025-08-13T11:27:29.915Z","direction":"out","message":{"id":"1755084449915-vr0rrgfzi","timestamp":"2025-08-13T11:27:29.915Z","type":"token.usage","data":{"phaseId":"phase-2","inputTokens":4,"outputTokens":440,"cacheCreationTokens":0,"cacheReadTokens":16483,"totalCost":0.0115569}},"metadata":{"size":226}}
{"loggedAt":"2025-08-13T11:27:29.916Z","direction":"out","message":{"id":"1755084449916-p6vhy56bl","timestamp":"2025-08-13T11:27:29.916Z","type":"file.updated","data":{"path":"notes/second_favorite_poem.txt","filename":"second_favorite_poem.txt","content":"<ENGLISH>\nBeside the meadow's golden streams\nWhere morning light does play,\nA child runs free among her dreams\nIn fields of endless May.\n\nThe daffodils dance all around\nIn gentle springtime breeze,\nWhile laughter fills the air with sound\nBeneath the blooming trees.\n\nShe gathers flowers, bright and fair,\nWith joy that knows no end,\nFor in this place beyond all care,\nThe earth becomes her friend.\n</ENGLISH>\n\n<KOREAN>\n황금빛 시냇가 옆에서\n아침 햇살이 노니는 곳,\n한 아이가 꿈속에서 자유롭게 뛰노니\n끝없는 오월의 들판에서.\n\n수선화들이 춤을 추네\n부드러운 봄바람에,\n웃음소리가 공기를 가득 채우는 동안\n꽃피는 나무들 아래에서.\n\n그녀는 꽃들을 모으네, 밝고 아름다운,\n끝없는 기쁨으로,\n이 근심 없는 곳에서,\n대지가 그녀의 친구가 되네.\n</KOREAN>\n\n*Inspired by William Wordsworth*","action":"created"}},"metadata":{"size":888}}
