{"loggedAt":"2025-08-13T11:28:11.667Z","direction":"out","message":{"id":"1755084491667-3rrh6jpo2","timestamp":"2025-08-13T11:28:11.667Z","type":"file.updated","data":{"path":"typescript_code/src/poem2.ts","filename":"poem2.ts","content":"export interface Poem {\n  title: string;\n  english: string[];\n  korean: string[];\n  inspiration: string;\n}\n\nexport const poem2: Poem = {\n  title: \"Golden Streams\",\n  english: [\n    \"Beside the meadow's golden streams\",\n    \"Where morning light does play,\",\n    \"A child runs free among her dreams\",\n    \"In fields of endless May.\",\n    \"\",\n    \"The daffodils dance all around\",\n    \"In gentle springtime breeze,\",\n    \"While laughter fills the air with sound\",\n    \"Beneath the blooming trees.\",\n    \"\",\n    \"She gathers flowers, bright and fair,\",\n    \"With joy that knows no end,\",\n    \"For in this place beyond all care,\",\n    \"The earth becomes her friend.\"\n  ],\n  korean: [\n    \"황금빛 시냇가 옆에서\",\n    \"아침 햇살이 노니는 곳,\",\n    \"한 아이가 꿈속에서 자유롭게 뛰노니\",\n    \"끝없는 오월의 들판에서.\",\n    \"\",\n    \"수선화들이 춤을 추네\",\n    \"부드러운 봄바람에,\",\n    \"웃음소리가 공기를 가득 채우는 동안\",\n    \"꽃피는 나무들 아래에서.\",\n    \"\",\n    \"그녀는 꽃들을 모으네, 밝고 아름다운,\",\n    \"끝없는 기쁨으로,\",\n    \"이 근심 없는 곳에서,\",\n    \"대지가 그녀의 친구가 되네.\"\n  ],\n  inspiration: \"Inspired by William Wordsworth\"\n};","action":"created"}},"metadata":{"size":1307}}
